{"title":"耐久度：長時間後段心率飄移","description":"耐久度：超過 90 分鐘的越野跑，後半段心率比前半段多飄幾 %。\n怎麼看：每個點 = 一次越野跑；灰虛線 = 5%，紅線 = 15%（後段掉很多）。\n看什麼：越低越好 = 越撐得住後段。同總覽「耐久度」。\n方法：WKO5 存的 Pa:HR（全程前半對後半，含暖身和停頓），不是判讀卡的算法（判讀卡不採用有坡的跑步）；登山混到休息時間所以不算，> 30% 當壞資料不畫。","kind":"athlete","axes":[{"id":"PERCENT","used":true,"unit":{"id":"PERCENT","label":"%","kind":"percent","dec":[[10,0],[0,1]],"scale":100.0}}],"parity":false,"fixes":[],"begin":"2026-09-27","end":"2026-10-03","workout":null,"series":[{"id":null,"name":"心率飄移","type":"line","color":"#e34948","y_axis":"PERCENT","x_axis":"DATE","line_style":"solid","line_width":"medium","expression":"if(hastag(\"runningtrail\") and duration > 5400 and abs(pahr) <= 0.3, pahr)","data":{"kind":"points","x":"datetime","points":[]},"unit":{"id":"PERCENT","label":"%","kind":"percent","dec":[[10,0],[0,1]],"scale":100.0},"x_unit":{"id":"DATE","label":"日期","kind":"date","dec":[[0,0]]},"ms":4},{"id":null,"name":"5%","type":"line","color":"#8a8984","y_axis":"PERCENT","x_axis":"DATE","line_style":"dash","line_width":"medium","expression":"(,0.05)","data":{"kind":"hline","y":0.05},"unit":{"id":"PERCENT","label":"%","kind":"percent","dec":[[10,0],[0,1]],"scale":100.0},"x_unit":{"id":"DATE","label":"日期","kind":"date","dec":[[0,0]]},"ms":0},{"id":null,"name":"15% 掉很多","type":"line","color":"#e34948","y_axis":"PERCENT","x_axis":"DATE","line_style":"dash","line_width":"medium","expression":"(,0.15)","data":{"kind":"hline","y":0.15},"unit":{"id":"PERCENT","label":"%","kind":"percent","dec":[[10,0],[0,1]],"scale":100.0},"x_unit":{"id":"DATE","label":"日期","kind":"date","dec":[[0,0]]},"ms":0}],"unsupported":[],"empty":"這段期間沒有資料。","notice":null,"plateau":null,"estimates":{},"basis":"pace","basis_default":"pace","basis_choices":["pace","power"],"basis_labels":{"pace":"配速","power":"功率"},"basis_toggle":true}